# vmetal-sushy-demo hardware inventory example
# Example format used by hack/generate-bmh.sh after Redfish discovery:
# NAME UUID MAC PROFILE FIRMWARE RACK CUSTOMER BMC_ADDRESS
#
# Notes:
# - NAME is the stable physical identity shown in the UI and used for the BMH name.
# - PROFILE is the size class inferred from Redfish hardware shape.
# - CUSTOMER comes from configs/rack-assignments.csv for pool assignment generation, not from Redfish itself.
# - BMC_ADDRESS should point at the full Redfish Systems resource.

